I can help with many MATLAB geometry tasks, including:

**2D geometry:** distances, angles, line intersections, point-in-polygon tests, polygon area/perimeter, convex hulls, rotations, translations, scaling, and coordinate transforms.

**3D geometry:** vectors, planes, spheres, line-plane intersections, 3D rotations, mesh geometry, surface normals, volumes, and coordinate systems.

**Computational geometry:** Delaunay triangulation, Voronoi diagrams, convex hulls, alpha shapes, nearest-neighbor searches, and spatial queries.

**Plotting and visualization:** 2D/3D shapes, parametric curves, surfaces, meshes, annotations, animations, and geometric transformations.

**Image/vision geometry:** object boundaries, shape measurements, region properties, edge geometry, camera geometry, homographies, and perspective transforms.

**Engineering/math geometry:** centroid calculations, moments of area, coordinate-frame transformations, robotics transforms, finite-element mesh prep, and CAD-like calculations.

For example, in MATLAB I can help you compute and plot a triangle’s area:

```matlab
P = [0 0; 4 0; 2 3];

areaTriangle = polyarea(P(:,1), P(:,2));

figure;
plot([P(:,1); P(1,1)], [P(:,2); P(1,2)], '-o');
axis equal;
grid on;
title("Triangle Area = " + areaTriangle);
```

I can also debug your geometry code, explain the math, or build full MATLAB scripts for specific tasks like intersection detection, shape fitting, or 3D visualization.

